{"ID":"20240314092242-74i2kyj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092242-74i2kyj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092242-74i2kyj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160530-70484un\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160530-0vtpjnh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:9,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160530-0vtpjnh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:43,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:43\u0026#125;","title":"【黄芪建中汤】（黄耆建中汤）","type":"doc","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422160530-70484un","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422160530-70484un","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚劳里急，诸不足，黄耆建中汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160530-hsxdz8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160530-hsxdz8v","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄耆建中汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160530-v46l3sy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160530-v46l3sy","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄耆建中汤方，即小建中汤内加黄耆一两半，余依上法，若气短胸满者加生姜；腹满者去枣加茯苓一两半；及疗肺虚损不足，补气加半夏三两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160530-q23lt86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160530-q23lt86","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来呢虚劳里急，慢慢呢诸位就了解到经方跟温病完全是南辕北辙，因为经方用的药比较强，而且呢，这个张仲景的书呢，言简刚重，几句话就讲完了，也没有交代很清楚，再加上呢徒弟过门槛呢又摔倒，然后条辩都弄不清楚，所以有的人就不用了啊，越来越不用，这个就很麻烦哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160530-ypl6on4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160530-ypl6on4","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这里呢，来看黄芪建中汤，刚刚讲了小建中，现在呢，黄芪建中也是虚劳里急啊，老师这个虚劳里急跟刚刚那个虚劳里急一样啊，诸不足哦，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芪建中汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢，你看看哦，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小建中汤里面再加黄芪"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160530-a3abg8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160530-a3abg8w","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那黄芪跟人参不一样，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人参"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢我一再跟诸位讲人参张仲景的观念里面是要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"养胃阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为肠胃的津液不够了，所以我们过去用独参汤，你说用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"独参汤来救逆，救什么逆啊？救胃气没有的逆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个人已经吃不下东西了，吃东西都吐，吐就是独参，单独的人参下去哦，独参汤！那黄芪呢，真正补气不是人参啊，是黄芪在补气啊，所以我们有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"气虚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"血虚两种虚劳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，哦，气虚还有血虚。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160530-0bcavhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160530-0bcavhc","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个黄芪建中汤呢煮法一样哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"若气短胸满者加生姜"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，为什么会气短胸满？这个生姜呢本身的功能是去肠胃里面的水，胃里面的水，如果这个人虚劳的时候，胃的消化不好嘛，胃里面有停水。这个时候呢，这个人胸腔里呼吸的时候，气没有办法下去，因为水停在中隔，它会反逆，这个时候用生姜，重用生姜哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160530-o2i9mn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160530-o2i9mn7","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"腹满者去枣加茯苓"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哦，肚子胀满，腹部是什么，是脾脏，脾主少腹，是主湿，所以腹满的时候一定是湿很盛，你看很多太太，小姐很好小姐是平的，太太呢那个后背是这样的，前面也是这样子（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腹前腹后都胀满"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），这个就是湿很盛，湿很盛哦，我们加了茯苓哦，后面会介绍到那个很多特殊的治症哦，那诸位一定要擅用茯苓，茯苓的话会让那个太太的肚子小掉，那个太太一定会对你很好，那这个是去湿用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160530-a9ygx73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160530-a9ygx73","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有疗，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"治疗肺虚损不足，补气加半夏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，什么叫做肺虚损不足？我们两个症，任何的脏病出来的时候，你把它归纳起来哦，就"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚跟实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，虚跟实哦。那当你肺虚损不足的时候哦，补气我们要补气加半夏，你说老师这个补气啊，黄芪在这边补气了，结果还要加个半夏，对不对，半夏这个不是去痰的吗？怎么"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去补气要用半夏？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个就是经方跟温病不一样的地方，经方认为说你有东西堵在里面的时候，滋补补不进去的，所以你这个虚劳的人呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"久虚劳的人呢里面一定有痰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以你一定要把这个痰去掉，就好像你要堆东西到仓库里面去，这个仓库里面还有坏死的东西在里面对不对，那你东西没有清掉，你把新的东西放进去，这不对的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以一定补气的时候加半夏，你半夏下去的时候把里面的痰清掉，这个时候才真正补得到气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这就是经方的观念。所以它这样子看起来非常合理啊，那你如果说老师我还是这个气跟血啊分辨不出来，再简单来讲就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"左手是血右手是气"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那如果左手脉，人是虚劳的，哦，虚劳就是告诉你怎么我睡觉睡了十个小时起来还是很累，还是感觉没有睡过，然后平常呢做什么事情懒洋洋的啊。那我也不想当台湾总统了啊，我也不想当立法委员，我什么都意志也没有，然后脉大，你看那个手脉那个血管也很大，然后人就没有精神，没有力哦，那就劳症嘛对不对。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"左手脉比较小就是血虚，右手脉比较小就是气虚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊，这样子看就可以了哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160530-0vtpjnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160530-0vtpjnh","updated":"20240422160530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以呢，半夏在里面的时候，可以把肺里面的痰清掉了，病人的气机就会非常流畅，就会补回来。"}]}]}